---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <BaseHead
            title={`Services | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
            description="What I can help with — data quality, analytics, and applied AI."
        />
    </head>
    <body>
        <Header />
        <main>
            <h1>What I can help with</h1>

            <h2>1. Data Quality &amp; SSOT Systems</h2>
            <p>
                Stop firefighting bad numbers. I design monitoring and
                reconciliation systems that catch data issues automatically —
                before they hit a dashboard or a decision.
            </p>

            <h2>2. Revenue &amp; Pipeline Analytics</h2>
            <p>
                Forecasting models, KPI frameworks, and dashboards (SQL,
                BigQuery, Power BI, Metabase) built for teams that need numbers
                they can actually trust.
            </p>

            <h2>3. Applied AI Tooling</h2>
            <p>
                Practical AI agents and utilities — not proofs of concept that
                never ship. If you need something that turns a manual data
                process into an automated one, this is where I can help.
            </p>

            <p>
                Not sure which of these fits your problem?
                <a href="mailto:abhishekkumar.singh0197@gmail.com"
                    >Get in touch →</a
                >
            </p>
        </main>
        <Footer />
    </body>
</html>
